Expand the challenge functionality with the following features:
1. add parameters to be sent along with the ingredient in order to further specify the challenge
	1. allow for a specific technique to be included, through a dropdown list. if no technique is chosen the API can decide on this.
	2. Cuisine (e.g. Asian, Latin-american, French, Italian etc....)
	3. Time available < 15 / < 30 / < 60 / > 60
	4. Small and Simple (Few ingredients, only those often found in the pantry) this is a tick the box, if this is chosen it will provide an easy recipe with few ingredients that are 	often in ones pantry.
2. It should always result in something usable, with a high quality recipe included in the answer. 
3. The challenge should always result in something edible or usable such as:
Component / Building Block: A foundational element meant to be part of a larger dish (e.g., a broth, stock, sauce, dressing, or pickle).
Anything eaten with your hands (e.g., a sandwich, taco, wrap, or burger). Plated Dish: A complete, structured meal, Small Plate / Appetizer: A light, starter-sized creation (e.g., a snack, dip, or finger food).